+## Symbolic list inputs
+
+```catala
+declaration scope ListInput:
+  input xs content list of integer
+  output length content integer
+  output positive_count content integer
+  output total content integer
+
+scope ListInput:
+  definition length equals number of xs
+  definition positive_count equals
+    number of (list of x among xs such that x > 0)
+  definition total equals
+    combine all x among xs in acc initially 0 with acc + x
+```
